# Generated artifacts — a single writer owns the formatting.
#
# flash-chamber-cases.json is emitted by
# apps/web/src/lib/thermal/__generators__/flashChamberFixtures.gen.ts and is
# consumed by the external dynamic-simulator work as a numerical gate. Letting
# prettier reformat it desyncs the committed file from its generator, so
# re-running the generator produces a spurious diff and the artifact stops
# being reproducible — which matters because another team gates against it.
docs/thermal/fixtures/flash-chamber-cases.json

